DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261013
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=12
SUMMARY:Hungary: Personal income tax advances withheld from employees: decl
 aration and payment
DESCRIPTION:The employer declares and pays the income tax advance withheld 
 by the 12th of the month following the accounted month (NAV: 'hónap 12-é
 ig' - up to and including the 12th).\nApplies to: Hungarian employers with
 holding personal income tax advances\nNon-working-day rule: check the sour
 ce.\n\nSource: https://nav.gov.hu/pfile/file?path=%2Fugyfeliranytu%2Fnezze
 n-utana%2Finf_fuz%2Frejtett%2FInformacios-fuzetek---Aktualis%2F24.-Bevalla
 si-adofizetesi-informaciok\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/dea
 dlines.html#hungary\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dat
 es follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays 
 are not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#hungary
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:hu-social-contribution-tax@intelligentpayroll.eu
DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261013
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=12
SUMMARY:Hungary: Social contribution tax: monthly declaration and payment
DESCRIPTION:The payer assesses social contribution tax monthly and declares
  and pays it by the 12th of the month following the reference month (NAV: 
 'hónap 12-ig' - up to and including the 12th).\nApplies to: Payers of soc
 ial contribution tax (employers)\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\
 n\nSource: https://nav.gov.hu/pfile/file?path=%2Fugyfeliranytu%2Fnezzen-ut
 ana%2Finf_fuz%2Frejtett%2FInformacios-fuzetek---Aktualis%2F24.-Bevallasi-a
 dofizetesi-informaciok\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlin
 es.html#hungary\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates f
 ollow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are 
 not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#hungary
